          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">When a friendly THOUSAND SONS PSYKER model with the Cabal of Sorcerers ability is destroyed, if that model is within 9&quot; of a model with this ability, you can select one of those models with this ability. When that selected model attempts a Ritual, it has +1 to the Psychic test result (to a maximum of +2).</characteristic>
